Notice on the tabulated data (data/ directory)

The CSV tables in data/ contain numerical values digitized from the design
charts of UFC 3-340-02, "Structures to Resist the Effects of Accidental
Explosions" (U.S. Department of Defense, 2008, Change 2 2014). UFC 3-340-02 is
approved for public release with unlimited distribution. The repository stores
only extracted numerical values, not the original chart artwork. The UFC
document itself is not covered by this license; the digitization,
SI normalization and table structure are provided under the terms above.

Engineering disclaimer: the Software reproduces an empirical design method and
is intended for research, teaching and verification of numerical models. It is
not a substitute for a qualified engineer's judgement, for the full UFC
3-340-02 procedure, or for site-specific threat and structural assessment.
